/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35b9080 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"35b9080\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Lucas Bennett is the CEO &amp; Founder of ALSHA, leading the studio with a clear vision for thoughtful, human-centered architecture. With extensive experience in both residential and commercial projects, he guides the creative direction of the practice while ensuring every design balances innovation, functionality, and long-term value.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e25d30 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"9e25d30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>He works closely with architects, designers, and clients throughout the entire process \u2014 from early concepts to final execution \u2014 shaping ideas into refined architectural solutions while maintaining clarity, precision, and a strong design identity.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cf8dc7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4cf8dc7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9d631b elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_image\" data-id=\"c9d631b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-contain